The Purge: Anarchy is a horror, thriller film directed by James DeMonaco.

2
00:09:21,818 --> 00:09:27,818
One night per year, the government sanctions a 12-hour period in which citizens can commit any
crime they wish -- including murder -- without fear of punishment or imprisonment.

3
00:14:02,727 --> 00:14:08,727
Leo, a sergeant who lost his son, plans a vigilante
mission of revenge during the mayhem.

4
00:18:43,636 --> 00:18:49,636
However, instead of a death-dealing avenger, he becomes the unexpected protector of four
innocent strangers who desperately need his help if they are to survive the night.

